// Courser V8 body: a mid-90s American front-engined V8 sports car with a T-top.
//
// Intent: long, low and wide. A very long sloping hood to a sharp, low nose with slim
// lamps in a strip, a steeply raked windshield, a short roof with two tinted glass panels,
// a long curved fastback glass over a hatch and a wide tail with three lamps a side under
// a lip. Black trim, turbine-style alloys, dual exhausts. Front engine, rear drive.
// Generic period cues only.
//
// Units are meters; x runs rearward from the nose, y up from the ground. Layout:
